## Interface: 16001
## Title: UlSource
## Notes: Records where your materials come from (mob drops, gathering nodes, chests, skinning) and shows it in the item tooltip: top sources, drop rate, zone and coordinates, last seen. Icons on the zone map where herbs, ore, chests and fish were found. Everything comes from your own looting.
